            "description": "As a platform operator, I want to migrate existing fixtures to verified seasons while preserving predictions and points, so that multi-season operation does not lose or misclassify historical data.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**\n1  Before enabling the expansion, match fixture IDs from seasons 26618 and 26998 against documented evidence. Do not default every row to LeagueId 732 or one SeasonId.\n2  After backfill, every active fixture has a verified season. Quarantine unclassified rows and produce a remediation report; do not publish unclassified records.\n3  Prediction, outcome, point-ledger and reward counts and relationships remain identical before and after migration. Migration performs no deletion or recalculation.\n4  After Redis is flushed, visibility remains database- and tenant-setting based. A rollback test restores the previous scope without deleting new seasons.\n\nRequired Changes  Use a staged nullable migration, followed by backfill, constraints and indexes. Replace ActiveSeasonFixtureScope with CompetitionSeasonScope and remove cached fixture IDs as the authoritative visibility source.\n\nDependencies  BE01; complete before releasing new-season functionality.",
