            "description": "<div>As a Super Admin, I want to assign competition access and defaults to each tenant, so that users only participate in competitions their tenant is entitled to offer.\n<br/></div><div><br/></div><div>Acceptance Criteria:<br/></div><div><br/></div><div>\n1  When saving tenant settings, validate WorldCup.TenantLeagues.Manage and plan coverage for every competition. Tenant Admins cannot expand their own subscription.\n<br/></div><div>2  Selected with an empty list exposes no competitions; AllEntitled exposes authorized competitions only. Migrated tenants retain their previous scope and are not automatically assigned Starter access.<br/></div><div>\n3  On plan change or competition disablement, reject invalid defaults, invalidate caches and review new jobs. Keep historical results and predictions stored.<br/></div><div>\n4  Concurrent setting changes use concurrencyStamp to prevent overwriting newer changes. Bootstrap returns a new configuration version after saving.\n\nRequired Changes  Add EntitlementResolver and CompetitionAccessPolicy. Use ABP Settings or a consistent typed table, with a transition plan for EnabledLeagueIds and SubscribedPlan.\n\nDependencies  BE01; approve selection modes and subscription rules.<br/></div>\n<hr/><div dir=\"rtl\">--- [ZOHO-ACTUAL-DELIVERY v1 | SNA-120-2026-10-28-01] ---<br/>ملحق مراجعة التنفيذ (لا يغيّر الحالة أو معايير القبول): مراجعة BMAD 10.3 وTenantLeagueService تشير إلى أن الاختيار الفارغ قد يُعامل كـ default-all في التنفيذ/الوثائق، بينما هذه القصة تشترط أن Selected بقائمة فارغة لا تعرض أي مسابقة وأن AllEntitled وحدها تعرض المسابقات المصرح بها. التعارض يحتاج قرار منتج ولا يُعد السلوك الحالي مطابقًا. لم يُتحقق تشغيليًا في هذه الجولة. الأدلة: BMAD 10.3؛ commits a81f9e40 و50565d34؛ TenantLeagueService.cs وTenantLeagueSettingsAppService.<br/>--- [/ZOHO-ACTUAL-DELIVERY | SNA-120-2026-10-28-01] ---</div>",
